config SERVICE_TTS
    bool "Text to speech"
    depends on SERVICE_SPEAKER && SPEAKER
    default y
    help
      Speaks the focused menu item with S.A.M. (Sadie '82 or the original
      1982 voice), so the watch can be used without looking at it.

if SERVICE_TTS

module = SERVICE_TTS
module-str = Text to speech
source "subsys/logging/Kconfig.template.log_level"

endif
